{"type": "sena", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "A Serious Image Problem"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "An Ethical Blunder"}, {"type": "position", "content": 3}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 4}, {"type": "level", "content": "B1.3"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Explain customs and appropriate behaviour at work and in different countries, using a wider range of expressions and formulas."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Understands important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about the communicative functions related to this level."}], "type": "objectives"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Negative Questions to Encourage Agreement"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " Negative questions have a different meaning than regular questions."}, {"type": "example", "content": " Wouldn't it be nice if we had such clothing ourselves?"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Isn't it convenient when regulations are different overseas?"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Shouldn't the organizers of the event do something about it?"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Don't you think we should start boycotting stores that sell Holly's apparel?"}, {"type": "text", "content": "You use negative questions to confirm information you already know, like Don't you think \u2026 ?"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Negative questions can have two different meanings."}, {"type": "text", "content": "You can ask a negative question for confirmation of a positive belief. <b />You can ask a negative question for confirmation of a negative belief."}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Be Supposed To and Be Going To in the Past Tense"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use the structures <span class=\"strong\">be supposed to</span> and <span class=\"strong\">be going to</span> when you want to talk about expectations, obligations or arrangements in the past."}, {"type": "example", "content": "I was going to watch it from home but decided to join the captivating event."}, {"type": "example", "content": "What was supposed to be a convivial event, ended up creating a tense situation."}, {"type": "example", "content": "A company that was supposed to dictate the wardrobes of wealthy middle-aged women relies on working children."}, {"type": "example", "content": "These children were supposed to be attending school or going to playing hide-and-seek."}, {"type": "example", "content": "That's what they were supposed to do in the first place."}, {"type": "text", "content": "You use <span class=\"strong\">be supposed to</span> to talk about situations in the past that were expected and that may or may not have happened."}, {"type": "text", "content": "The structure is:"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Subject + was/were + supposed to + verb"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Example: <b /><span class=\"italic\">It <span class=\"strong\">was supposed to be</span> a convivial event.</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": " "}, {"type": "text", "content": "You use <span class=\"strong\">be going to</span> in the past to talk about something that was expected but did not happen."}, {"type": "text", "content": "The structure is:"}, {"type": "text", "content": " Subject + was/were going to + verb"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Example:<b /> <span class=\"italic\">I <span class=\"strong\">was going to watch</span> it from home but decided to join the captivating event.</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": " "}, {"type": "text", "content": " "}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">NOTE</span>: When you say be supposed to, you link the /d/ and /t/ sounds together, like this: <span class=\"italic\">be suppose_to</span>"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "convenient"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "suitable for \u200byour \u200bpurposes and \u200bneeds and \u200bcausing the least \u200bdifficulty"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Isn't it convenient when regulations are different overseas?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn8le04ob03aud04"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use to express feelings about a subject."}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "convivial"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "fun; friendly"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: What was supposed to be a convivial event, ended up creating a tense situation."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn8le04ob03aud02"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "alarming"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "causing worry or fear"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example:  I know it's alarming, but the clothing store Holly's invests in child labor. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn8le04ob03aud03"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "compassionate"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "feeling sympathy for people and a need to help them"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example:  If you ask me, companies like this are supposed to use even more compassionate practices when dealing cross-culturally."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn8le04ob03aud05"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "thrilling"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "exciting"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: It's always thrilling to participate in the glamour and imagine ourselves just a little more beautiful!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn8le04ob03aud01"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "overwhelmed"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "suddenly feeling strong emotion"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You may feel overwhelmed by such scenarios."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn8le04ob03aud06"}], 